WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.440 --> 00:12.039
[Episode 3]

3
00:12.626 --> 00:14.705
Are you Mr. Chen Wan?

4
00:14.705 --> 00:16.785
Mr. Chen, please assist us with an investigation.

5
00:16.785 --> 00:18.143
This way.

6
00:25.506 --> 00:28.365
Mr. Zhao, where to now?

7
00:30.506 --> 00:32.109
Miwang Road.

8
00:33.585 --> 00:35.466
Why isn't Zhao Sheng Ge here yet?

9
00:35.466 --> 00:38.146
I'm starving.

10
00:38.146 --> 00:39.225
He should be here soon.

11
00:39.225 --> 00:40.946
He just said he was on his way.

12
00:40.946 --> 00:42.026
My apologies.

13
00:42.026 --> 00:43.385
Sorry to keep you waiting.

14
00:43.385 --> 00:45.652
You'll have to drink a penalty shot later.

15
00:48.745 --> 00:51.306
You seem to be in a good mood.

16
00:51.306 --> 00:52.866
I've always been in a good mood.

17
00:52.866 --> 00:54.185
Sheng Ge.

18
00:54.185 --> 00:56.626
How did the talk with Shao Yao Zong go?

19
00:56.626 --> 00:58.346
Being able to negotiate with him this time

20
00:58.346 --> 00:59.745
is all thanks to Jiang Sheng's connection.

21
00:59.745 --> 01:01.226
We'll need to keep an eye on him later.

22
01:01.226 --> 01:02.866
I'll watch him, don't worry.

23
01:02.866 --> 01:04.586
Since we're off to such a smooth start,

24
01:04.586 --> 01:06.465
why don't we go out to sea to celebrate?

25
01:06.465 --> 01:07.866
Sure.

26
01:07.866 --> 01:10.026
Let's take the Whale 17 then.

27
01:10.026 --> 01:11.745
It's been idle since its maiden voyage.

28
01:11.745 --> 01:14.506
We can set sail from Lychee Bay.

29
01:14.506 --> 01:16.105
So high-profile?

30
01:16.105 --> 01:18.306
You want to show the He family your strength

31
01:18.306 --> 01:19.825
and the prospects of Lychee Bay.

32
01:19.825 --> 01:20.866
Exactly.

33
01:20.866 --> 01:22.586
Isn't Xu Zhi Ying, the ship king's granddaughter,

34
01:22.586 --> 01:24.465
the one your old man wants as a daughter-in-law?

35
01:24.465 --> 01:26.726
You want to bring them into the deal?

36
01:27.586 --> 01:30.625
I heard she's coming back from abroad soon.

37
01:30.625 --> 01:32.745
I've dealt with Xu Zhi Ying before.

38
01:32.745 --> 01:33.946
She's not that simple.

39
01:33.946 --> 01:35.545
All right, let's not talk about that.

40
01:35.545 --> 01:37.226
The Whale 17 is way too big.

41
01:37.226 --> 01:40.066
With just us, we'll be lost on that ship.

42
01:40.066 --> 01:41.706
Then invite some people.

43
01:41.706 --> 01:43.866
I want to invite Chen Wan.

44
01:43.866 --> 01:45.726
Suit yourself.

45
01:55.506 --> 01:56.706
I didn't say anything.

46
01:56.706 --> 01:58.146
Leave this to me.

47
01:58.146 --> 02:00.265
Don't worry.

48
02:00.265 --> 02:03.745
I'll definitely invite the right people.

49
02:03.745 --> 02:06.125
Let's pick a bottle of wine.

50
02:11.066 --> 02:12.786
Chen Wan has been very busy lately.

51
02:12.786 --> 02:15.345
Lately, something happened at Kexiang.

52
02:15.345 --> 02:17.026
He's been so busy, he barely has time to sleep.

53
02:17.026 --> 02:18.345
But when I said it was you

54
02:18.345 --> 02:20.146
inviting everyone out to sea,

55
02:20.146 --> 02:21.546
he agreed immediately.

56
02:21.546 --> 02:23.665
He even asked if he could help.

57
02:23.665 --> 02:26.065
Chen Wan is so thoughtful.

58
02:26.065 --> 02:28.386
He's always the one helping others.

59
02:28.386 --> 02:29.745
He's not like those spoiled heirs

60
02:29.745 --> 02:30.745
who only come for the fun

61
02:30.745 --> 02:31.945
and can't help with anything.

62
02:31.945 --> 02:33.306
There are many people this time,

63
02:33.306 --> 02:34.826
including many new faces.

64
02:34.826 --> 02:36.586
They don't all know Chen Wan.

65
02:36.586 --> 02:39.225
They can be quite reckless.

66
02:39.225 --> 02:41.586
Don't let them look down on him.

67
02:41.586 --> 02:42.826
- Don't let him be bullied. - Of course.

68
02:42.826 --> 02:45.765
Chen Wan is my friend, too.

69
02:48.426 --> 02:49.905
I invited him to relax.

70
02:49.905 --> 02:51.586
Anyway, don't tire him out.

71
02:51.586 --> 02:54.565
Fine. I get it.

72
03:02.225 --> 03:03.986
Sir, Officer He gave us an update.

73
03:03.986 --> 03:05.026
He said the man is tight-lipped.

74
03:05.026 --> 03:06.026
After an hour of questioning,

75
03:06.026 --> 03:07.505
he didn't mention your name once.

76
03:07.505 --> 03:08.665
He claimed he was just doing a good deed,

77
03:08.665 --> 03:10.386
taking mainland tourists there.

78
03:10.386 --> 03:12.386
Anything else?

79
03:12.386 --> 03:13.386
We checked his phone.

80
03:13.386 --> 03:15.345
No records of contact with Baihe Hall.

81
03:15.345 --> 03:16.945
He has no criminal record either.

82
03:16.945 --> 03:19.496
- He's clean. - Okay, I see.

83
03:20.345 --> 03:22.087
Sheng.

84
03:24.465 --> 03:26.115
Where did Nian go?

85
03:27.586 --> 03:29.117
I don't know.

86
03:36.905 --> 03:39.146
Mr. Chen, when will the outdoor pool open?

87
03:39.146 --> 03:40.905
It will be open in half an hour.

88
03:40.905 --> 03:43.705
- Just wait a moment. - Okay.

89
03:43.705 --> 03:44.745
Mr. Chen.

90
03:44.745 --> 03:46.745
Are there any good wines in the cellar you could recommend?

91
03:46.745 --> 03:48.745
I'll have the manager give you a list.

92
03:48.745 --> 03:50.425
I recommend a newly acquired champagne.

93
03:50.425 --> 03:52.626
It has a very refreshing taste, perfect for this weather.

94
03:52.626 --> 03:54.095
Thank you.

95
03:56.106 --> 03:57.146
Mr. Zhuo.

96
03:57.146 --> 03:58.266
Don't blame me for this.

97
03:58.266 --> 04:01.266
Without him, I really couldn't manage.

98
04:01.266 --> 04:03.106
It's as if Chen Wan built this ship himself.

99
04:03.106 --> 04:05.465
He knows every detail of it.

100
04:05.465 --> 04:06.505
Regarding that last project,

101
04:06.505 --> 04:09.106
we're already 60 percent done.

102
04:09.106 --> 04:11.266
The busy man is here.

103
04:11.266 --> 04:12.386
Not as busy as you.

104
04:12.386 --> 04:15.059
All right, all right. Thanks, sir.

105
04:17.146 --> 04:18.706
- Let's set sail. - Okay.

106
04:18.706 --> 04:20.111
Go ahead.

107
04:21.625 --> 04:23.505
My dad got a batch of good wine recently.

108
04:23.505 --> 04:24.505
I took a bottle.

109
04:24.505 --> 04:25.785
Let's try it later.

110
04:25.785 --> 04:27.706
Only one bottle from the whole batch?

111
04:27.706 --> 04:30.177
Then I really must try it.

112
04:34.026 --> 04:36.345
Mr. Chen, have a drink.

113
04:40.786 --> 04:41.786
Ladies and gentlemen.

114
04:41.786 --> 04:44.305
This is a broadcast from Whale 17.

115
04:44.305 --> 04:46.905
We have officially entered international waters.

116
04:46.905 --> 04:49.225
Please be careful when you are

117
04:49.225 --> 04:50.266
on the deck or by the ship's rails.

118
04:50.266 --> 04:51.665
We hope you enjoy your time at sea.

119
04:51.665 --> 04:53.543
No way.

120
04:55.105 --> 04:56.746
Mr. Qin is truly impressive.

121
04:56.746 --> 04:57.946
Like father, like son.

122
04:57.946 --> 05:01.425
His father is the stock king of Hai City.

123
05:01.425 --> 05:03.114
Zhao Sheng Ge is here.

124
05:18.706 --> 05:19.746
Mr. Zhao.

125
05:19.746 --> 05:21.173
Mr. Tan.

126
05:25.586 --> 05:27.026
Zong Nian. You play.

127
05:27.026 --> 05:29.026
If Shen Zong Nian plays, it's like cheating.

128
05:29.026 --> 05:30.225
I'm not playing either.

129
05:30.225 --> 05:32.785
Who can beat Mr. Qin?

130
05:32.785 --> 05:36.406
Unless... we let Chen Wan be the dealer.

131
05:37.386 --> 05:38.465
There's a reason for that?

132
05:38.465 --> 05:39.946
You'll see in a moment.

133
05:39.946 --> 05:41.091
Wan.

134
05:47.665 --> 05:49.385
Since I'm the dealer,

135
05:49.385 --> 05:51.385
and we're in international waters,

136
05:51.385 --> 05:53.865
let's use a saying from Mr. Shen's casino.

137
05:53.865 --> 05:57.345
The dealer is God, the dealer is the master.

138
05:57.345 --> 05:58.706
Since you're at my table,

139
05:58.706 --> 06:00.946
then you must follow my rules.

140
06:00.946 --> 06:03.746
Hitting, drawing, and maximum antes.

141
06:03.746 --> 06:05.506
I'll allow you to cheat,

142
06:05.506 --> 06:08.026
but you must allow me to intervene.

143
06:08.026 --> 06:10.865
We'll each rely on our own skills.

144
06:10.865 --> 06:13.105
Interesting.

145
06:13.105 --> 06:15.425
Today, we're playing Ghost Duel.

146
06:15.425 --> 06:18.465
The basic rules are similar to Stud Poker.

147
06:18.465 --> 06:19.731
The difference is,

148
06:19.731 --> 06:23.045
I'll add a Ghost Card to every deck.

149
06:25.545 --> 06:27.305
You can think of it as a wild card.

150
06:27.305 --> 06:29.146
The winner of the previous round

151
06:29.146 --> 06:31.586
can draw an extra card in this round.

152
06:31.586 --> 06:34.067
Now, let the game begin.

153
06:41.305 --> 06:42.506
All right.

154
06:42.506 --> 06:44.545
Hole cards are set.

155
06:44.545 --> 06:46.465
Queen of Spades to act.

156
06:46.465 --> 06:48.225
- 50. - Call.

157
06:48.225 --> 06:50.026
Call.

158
06:50.026 --> 06:51.291
Fold.

159
06:57.826 --> 06:59.266
- 100. - Fold.

160
06:59.266 --> 07:00.616
Fold.

161
07:04.905 --> 07:05.946
Fold.

162
07:05.946 --> 07:07.146
Fold.

163
07:07.146 --> 07:08.508
Fold.

164
07:10.305 --> 07:12.386
Fold.

165
07:12.386 --> 07:14.706
- Fold. - Mr. Zhao keeps folding.

166
07:14.706 --> 07:16.706
I wonder what he's thinking.

167
07:16.706 --> 07:19.386
Mr. Qin is on a roll today.

168
07:19.386 --> 07:21.305
This dealer is no good.

169
07:21.305 --> 07:23.665
The players aren't even excited to see their cards.

170
07:23.665 --> 07:28.146
Dealer, did you get caught cheating?

171
07:28.146 --> 07:29.905
Then I really should go back to Mr. Shen's casino

172
07:29.905 --> 07:32.246
to refine my skills further.

173
07:33.506 --> 07:35.624
King of Hearts to act.

174
07:38.826 --> 07:41.225
50.

175
07:41.225 --> 07:42.706
50, call.

176
07:42.706 --> 07:44.038
Fold.

177
07:48.105 --> 07:50.146
Call.

178
07:50.146 --> 07:54.535
Mr. Zhao, this hand seems to have caught your eye.

179
08:07.465 --> 08:08.506
100.

180
08:08.506 --> 08:09.912
Call.

181
08:13.946 --> 08:15.162
Fold.

182
08:20.826 --> 08:21.865
Mr. Zhao.

183
08:21.865 --> 08:23.186
As the MVP of the last round,

184
08:23.186 --> 08:25.345
you have one chance to draw a card.

185
08:25.345 --> 08:27.146
Would you like to?

186
08:27.146 --> 08:28.386
Can I pick one myself?

187
08:28.386 --> 08:31.616
According to the rules, I have to deal it for you.

188
08:43.266 --> 08:46.746
Dealer, can I decline?

189
08:46.746 --> 08:48.160
You can.

190
09:06.305 --> 09:08.146
100.

191
09:08.146 --> 09:09.965
Double.

192
09:11.106 --> 09:13.305
What if I have a straight flush?

193
09:13.305 --> 09:16.506
The odds of a straight flush are 0.015%.

194
09:16.506 --> 09:19.986
The odds of my straight are 0.39%.

195
09:19.986 --> 09:21.346
Do you still want to raise?

196
09:21.346 --> 09:23.406
If not, let's continue.

197
09:27.705 --> 09:29.064
Continue.

198
10:09.065 --> 10:11.825
Sheng, if your hole card is a Queen,

199
10:11.825 --> 10:13.106
you'll definitely beat me.

200
10:13.106 --> 10:16.506
If not, my King is still higher than yours.

201
10:16.506 --> 10:18.665
It's fine.

202
10:18.665 --> 10:20.065
Showdown.

203
10:20.065 --> 10:23.085
Plus a shop on Nathan Road.

204
10:25.945 --> 10:27.845
Are you in?

205
10:30.346 --> 10:31.649
Fold.

206
10:34.226 --> 10:35.866
Three of Clubs.

207
10:35.866 --> 10:37.617
My apologies.

208
10:40.386 --> 10:44.425
Zong Nian, a dealer like this in your casino

209
10:44.425 --> 10:46.425
must earn at least this much, right?

210
10:46.425 --> 10:48.226
Indeed.

211
10:48.226 --> 10:50.060
And that's in pounds.

212
10:55.146 --> 10:56.386
Fold.

213
10:56.386 --> 10:57.425
Fold.

214
10:57.425 --> 10:59.146
I already have the Ace.

215
10:59.146 --> 11:01.705
Even if you draw the Nine of Spades, it's useless.

216
11:01.705 --> 11:04.213
Ten shops on Prince's East Street.

217
11:05.626 --> 11:07.673
I want Qiongxi Manor.

218
11:10.705 --> 11:12.106
Call.

219
11:13.746 --> 11:15.196
Draw.

220
11:22.065 --> 11:23.626
I'll reveal it later.

221
11:23.626 --> 11:25.461
No problem, right?

222
11:26.545 --> 11:28.885
No problem, Mr. Zhao.

223
11:42.226 --> 11:44.245
Please show your hand.

224
11:47.425 --> 11:49.610
Straight flush.

225
11:50.905 --> 11:51.986
It's an Earth Dragon.

226
11:51.986 --> 11:53.506
Only a Heaven Dragon is higher than it.

227
11:53.506 --> 11:55.065
But the Ace is already gone.

228
11:55.065 --> 11:57.124
Zhao Sheng Ge has definitely lost.

229
12:04.986 --> 12:07.286
What is that?

230
12:15.825 --> 12:17.866
God strives to maintain fairness,

231
12:17.866 --> 12:20.785
but the heart inevitably shows favoritism.

232
12:20.785 --> 12:24.386
If Zhao Sheng Ge needs it, he will find that hole card.

233
12:24.386 --> 12:25.626
If he doesn't need it,

234
12:25.626 --> 12:27.785
then it will never be discovered.

235
12:27.785 --> 12:31.866
Of course, I still hope he never has to use it.

236
12:31.866 --> 12:35.106
I hope Zhao Sheng Ge's path is smooth

237
12:35.106 --> 12:37.001
and everything goes his way.

238
12:38.146 --> 12:39.266
All right, let's head back.

239
12:39.266 --> 12:41.945
Mr. Chen. Let's have dinner sometime.

240
12:41.945 --> 12:43.466
You guys go ahead. I'll join you in a bit.

241
12:43.466 --> 12:45.185
- All right. - Okay.

242
12:45.185 --> 12:47.245
Over here.

243
13:06.106 --> 13:08.571
Mr. Zhao, you're out here for the view too?

244
13:09.545 --> 13:12.574
The view here is great and very relaxing.

245
13:18.226 --> 13:20.920
You had a good run today, Mr. Zhao.

246
13:26.665 --> 13:30.065
Mr. Zhao, please rest. I won't disturb you.

247
13:30.065 --> 13:31.534
Chen Wan.

248
13:37.106 --> 13:39.090
I didn't bring a lighter.

249
14:02.266 --> 14:04.129
Why are you shaking?

250
14:11.506 --> 14:12.785
Damn.

251
14:12.785 --> 14:14.538
So beautiful.

252
14:35.626 --> 14:36.664
I don't smoke.

253
14:36.664 --> 14:37.951
It's a bit windy.

254
14:37.951 --> 14:39.295
This lighter isn't anything fancy.

255
14:39.295 --> 14:41.036
Please make do with it, Mr. Zhao.

256
14:43.945 --> 14:45.506
I couldn't find you anywhere.

257
14:45.506 --> 14:47.386
So, you two are here.

258
14:47.386 --> 14:48.705
I came out to clear my head from the wine.

259
14:48.705 --> 14:50.346
I happened to run into Mr. Zhao.

260
14:50.346 --> 14:52.065
Come back once you've rested enough.

261
14:52.065 --> 14:54.185
You Ming is rushing everyone to the table.

262
14:54.185 --> 14:55.506
Then, Mr. Zhao, I'll...

263
14:55.506 --> 14:57.585
What's the hurry?

264
14:57.585 --> 15:00.065
You won't even let me finish my cigarette.

265
15:00.065 --> 15:01.945
If the auspicious hour passes...

266
15:01.945 --> 15:05.106
That's bad luck, isn't it?

267
15:05.106 --> 15:07.106
Mr. Qin is very particular about Feng Shui.

268
15:07.106 --> 15:09.705
Even at the table, he cares about seating.

269
15:09.705 --> 15:11.600
Auspicious timing is everything.

270
15:15.866 --> 15:17.905
Mr. Zhao has won too much tonight.

271
15:17.905 --> 15:20.665
He just wants to leave some luck for everyone else.

272
15:20.665 --> 15:22.586
What about you, Mr. Chen?

273
15:27.946 --> 15:30.106
I'll stay here for a while.

274
15:30.106 --> 15:33.226
I'd like to soak up some of Mr. Zhao's luck.

275
15:33.226 --> 15:36.872
Mr. Qin, we'll see if it works at the table later.

276
15:36.872 --> 15:38.106
All right.

277
15:38.106 --> 15:40.980
We'll see if it works.

278
15:54.866 --> 15:56.825
Give it to me.

279
15:56.825 --> 15:58.229
No need.

280
16:05.065 --> 16:07.425
Mr. Shi, you're on a roll.

281
16:07.425 --> 16:08.545
It's all right.

282
16:08.545 --> 16:10.665
You've made quite a profit.

283
16:10.665 --> 16:12.785
I don't believe I can't beat you.

284
16:12.785 --> 16:14.462
Come on, again.

285
16:20.185 --> 16:21.346
Mr. Huang.

286
16:21.346 --> 16:23.065
Mr. Shi, Mr. Su.

287
16:23.065 --> 16:25.825
Still playing Ghost Duel?

288
16:25.825 --> 16:27.011
Chen Wan.

289
16:28.226 --> 16:30.146
You want to play too?

290
16:30.146 --> 16:32.576
But the table is full.

291
16:36.026 --> 16:37.603
You guys go ahead.

292
16:39.665 --> 16:41.618
Thank you, Mr. Huang.

293
16:43.226 --> 16:45.591
Everyone, the game begins.

294
16:48.866 --> 16:50.505
Please place your bets.

295
16:52.458 --> 16:53.971
Fold.

296
16:58.305 --> 16:59.425
My apologies.

297
16:59.425 --> 17:01.106
Thank you for taking it easy on me.

298
17:01.106 --> 17:02.106
Fold.

299
17:02.106 --> 17:03.705
Fold.

300
17:03.705 --> 17:05.019
Fold.

301
17:06.106 --> 17:08.665
Isn't he just throwing money away?

302
17:08.665 --> 17:12.866
He might be, but the others won't.

303
17:12.866 --> 17:13.986
Chen Wan.

304
17:13.986 --> 17:16.186
I didn't expect you to be a better player than you are a dealer.

305
17:16.186 --> 17:19.593
Then I must thank Mr. Zhao for lending me his luck.

306
17:21.065 --> 17:24.186
It's more like... this luck...

307
17:24.186 --> 17:26.105
is what I'm returning to you.

308
17:27.865 --> 17:30.092
Everyone, please show your cards.

309
17:33.145 --> 17:34.545
Sorry, everyone.

310
17:34.545 --> 17:37.145
When luck comes, there's no stopping it.

311
17:38.906 --> 17:40.506
Chen Wan.

312
17:40.506 --> 17:42.666
Mr. Zhao lent you his luck.

313
17:42.666 --> 17:45.746
Borrowed luck always runs out eventually.

314
17:45.746 --> 17:47.666
By the way, Chen Wan,

315
17:47.666 --> 17:50.305
I'm afraid you'll run out of money to lose.

316
17:50.305 --> 17:52.065
How about... that watch on your wrist?

317
17:52.065 --> 17:54.017
Bet it.

318
17:55.825 --> 17:56.986
It's a personal item.

319
17:56.986 --> 17:59.186
It's not worth much.

320
17:59.186 --> 18:01.906
Sheng, we've been on Showdown all night.

321
18:01.906 --> 18:04.020
Is there anything else to play?

322
18:05.625 --> 18:07.906
You're quite demanding.

323
18:07.906 --> 18:10.145
What do you want to play?

324
18:10.145 --> 18:13.168
I recall Mr. Su studied in the UK.

325
18:14.666 --> 18:16.065
Why don't we play...

326
18:16.065 --> 18:17.635
Whist?

327
18:18.785 --> 18:20.026
I'm familiar with that one.

328
18:20.026 --> 18:22.946
But I don't know about the others.

329
18:22.946 --> 18:24.616
I'm okay with it.

330
18:25.986 --> 18:27.186
I'm game.

331
18:27.186 --> 18:28.666
Then let's play Whist.

332
18:28.666 --> 18:30.062
Sure.

333
18:31.506 --> 18:34.385
Whist is played in two opposing teams.

334
18:34.385 --> 18:36.026
Partners sit opposite each other.

335
18:36.026 --> 18:38.065
A suit will be drawn for each round

336
18:38.065 --> 18:40.145
to represent the highest trump card.

337
18:40.145 --> 18:43.746
The trump card for this round is Hearts.

338
18:43.746 --> 18:45.266
There are thirteen tricks per round.

339
18:45.266 --> 18:46.706
The team that wins the most tricks

340
18:46.706 --> 18:48.825
is the winner of the round.

341
18:48.825 --> 18:50.746
Is Whist similar to Bridge?

342
18:50.746 --> 18:53.466
Bridge was actually derived from Whist.

343
18:53.466 --> 18:57.509
Except there's no dummy hand and no bidding.

344
18:58.666 --> 19:00.385
I'll be the dealer this round.

345
19:00.385 --> 19:03.065
I'll take at least ten tricks.

346
19:03.065 --> 19:05.186
Chen Wan, are you with me?

347
19:05.186 --> 19:06.536
I'm in.

348
19:07.785 --> 19:09.666
Then I'm in, too.

349
19:09.666 --> 19:12.426
I'll bet that you won't get ten tricks.

350
19:12.426 --> 19:14.065
Chen Wan.

351
19:14.065 --> 19:16.542
When I play, I play to win.

352
19:18.545 --> 19:20.105
Of course.

353
19:20.105 --> 19:22.746
Mr. Shi, it's your turn to play.

354
19:22.746 --> 19:25.345
There are thirteen tricks in a deck.

355
19:25.345 --> 19:26.825
Zhao Sheng Ge wants to take ten.

356
19:26.825 --> 19:27.826
That's a bit ridiculous.

357
19:27.826 --> 19:30.523
Don't underestimate Zhao Sheng Ge.

358
19:33.585 --> 19:35.173
One trick.

359
19:48.825 --> 19:50.612
Two tricks.

360
20:05.186 --> 20:06.906
Three tricks.

361
20:06.906 --> 20:08.585
Mr. Zhao.

362
20:08.585 --> 20:11.706
If we win just one more trick, you'll lose.

363
20:11.706 --> 20:14.746
Let's bet everything we won at the table just now.

364
20:14.746 --> 20:17.625
I'll add a set of shops in Prince's East.

365
20:17.625 --> 20:18.890
Mr. Su.

366
20:18.890 --> 20:22.225
Bet that piece of land by the Wangchun Corner building.

367
20:23.506 --> 20:25.586
I'm with you.

368
20:27.946 --> 20:30.266
Why didn't Wan play his King of Hearts earlier?

369
20:30.266 --> 20:33.266
Now it's been trumped, we've lost a high card.

370
20:33.266 --> 20:35.125
He's fishing.

371
20:35.865 --> 20:37.516
One trick.

372
20:56.506 --> 20:58.156
Two tricks.

373
21:07.145 --> 21:08.619
Three tricks.

374
21:10.466 --> 21:13.266
If the Queen of Hearts is in Mr. Su's hand,

375
21:13.266 --> 21:15.026
won't they be finished?

376
21:15.026 --> 21:16.579
It won't be.

377
21:22.746 --> 21:23.986
Four tricks.

378
21:23.986 --> 21:25.345
It's really not there.

379
21:25.345 --> 21:26.865
But Zhao Sheng Ge is truly ruthless.

380
21:26.865 --> 21:28.426
He's fishing for trumps so hard,

381
21:28.426 --> 21:30.635
he doesn't even care about his partner.

382
21:34.385 --> 21:36.865
How did Zhao Sheng Ge know the King of Hearts was in Wan's hand?

383
21:36.865 --> 21:39.785
Five tricks!

384
21:39.785 --> 21:41.625
They've been making eyes at each other for so long.

385
21:41.625 --> 21:43.574
Can't you see it?

386
21:51.426 --> 21:53.132
Six tricks!

387
21:55.105 --> 21:56.575
The game is over.

388
22:00.065 --> 22:01.723
Seven tricks!

389
22:12.105 --> 22:13.723
Queen of Clubs.

390
22:24.706 --> 22:26.518
Eight tricks.

391
22:37.065 --> 22:38.634
Nine tricks.

392
22:50.986 --> 22:52.505
King of Hearts.

393
22:52.505 --> 22:53.506
The Knight card.

394
22:53.506 --> 22:54.785
According to social custom,

395
22:54.785 --> 22:56.186
whoever gets Zhao Sheng Ge's Knight card

396
22:56.186 --> 22:57.825
can make a request of him.

397
22:57.825 --> 22:59.604
Any request.

398
23:00.545 --> 23:01.825
It's gone.

399
23:01.825 --> 23:03.631
The Knight card.

400
23:06.065 --> 23:07.682
What does he mean by this?

401
23:08.825 --> 23:10.105
We're leaving so soon?

402
23:10.105 --> 23:11.371
Let's go.

403
23:12.305 --> 23:13.506
Let's go for a drink then.

404
23:13.506 --> 23:16.067
I know a good bottle at the bar.

405
23:18.026 --> 23:19.619
Wan.

406
23:26.706 --> 23:28.226
Please clear the cards.

407
23:28.226 --> 23:29.955
Let's start the next round.

408
23:34.385 --> 23:35.625
Clear the cards.

409
23:35.625 --> 23:37.522
- Continue. - Okay.

410
23:46.305 --> 23:47.924
Thank you.

411
23:49.466 --> 23:50.625
For what?

412
23:50.625 --> 23:53.385
Thank you for lending me your luck, Mr. Zhao.

413
23:53.385 --> 23:54.931
You're welcome.

414
23:59.746 --> 24:01.152
Wan.

415
24:04.706 --> 24:07.026
Didn't Zhao Sheng Ge just lose a shopfront to you?

416
24:07.026 --> 24:09.925
How about I trade you a piece of land in the outskirts for it?

417
24:10.986 --> 24:13.105
I also won one on Miwang Road.

418
24:13.105 --> 24:14.882
Why don't we trade for that one instead?

419
24:15.825 --> 24:17.906
Sure. Thanks.

420
24:17.906 --> 24:19.065
It's nothing.

421
24:19.065 --> 24:20.589
Take care.

422
24:27.345 --> 24:28.385
Xuan.

423
24:28.385 --> 24:30.946
What's wrong? Upset because you lost too much?

424
24:30.946 --> 24:32.545
Wan.

425
24:32.545 --> 24:35.785
Why didn't you take Zhao Sheng Ge's Knight card?

426
24:35.785 --> 24:37.065
I didn't think it was appropriate.

427
24:37.065 --> 24:38.746
People like Zhao Sheng Ge and Shen Zong Nian

428
24:38.746 --> 24:40.545
never play the Knight card.

429
24:40.545 --> 24:42.906
Do you know how many people were green with envy?

430
24:42.906 --> 24:44.746
What a waste of a golden opportunity.

431
24:44.746 --> 24:46.506
That's the King of Hearts.

432
24:46.506 --> 24:47.865
It's too suggestive.

433
24:47.865 --> 24:49.865
I know.

434
24:49.865 --> 24:52.426
It's usually given to casino girls.

435
24:52.426 --> 24:54.385
But you shouldn't overthink it.

436
24:54.385 --> 24:56.065
We could have dealt with the rest later.

437
24:56.065 --> 24:57.625
Zhao Sheng Ge wouldn't take it seriously.

438
24:57.625 --> 24:59.506
But I would mind.

439
24:59.506 --> 25:01.186
Xuan.

440
25:01.186 --> 25:03.105
I don't have those intentions.

441
25:03.105 --> 25:06.946
I won't be a lover, nor will I play games.

442
25:06.946 --> 25:10.026
Then why didn't you trade the shopfront at Wangchun Corner with Tan You Ming?

443
25:10.026 --> 25:11.506
That's different.

444
25:11.506 --> 25:12.625
The shop at Wangchun Corner...

445
25:12.625 --> 25:15.385
Zhao Sheng Ge won it by building momentum.

446
25:15.385 --> 25:17.625
The card just happened to fall to me,

447
25:17.625 --> 25:19.065
so it became mine.

448
25:19.065 --> 25:20.865
I can consider it...

449
25:20.865 --> 25:23.345
a gift from him.

450
25:23.345 --> 25:26.986
Chen Wan, are you sick?

451
25:26.986 --> 25:29.746
Haven't you always thought I was sick?

452
25:29.746 --> 25:31.906
I am a patient.

453
25:31.906 --> 25:34.466
I can't control myself.

454
25:34.466 --> 25:38.226
If this feeling crosses the line or is voiced,

455
25:38.226 --> 25:41.825
I will never let Zhao Sheng Ge go again,

456
25:41.825 --> 25:43.626
whether he loves me or not.

457
25:43.626 --> 25:45.506
Don't think too much.

458
25:45.506 --> 25:47.666
Monica said as long as you cooperate with the treatment,

459
25:47.666 --> 25:49.470
it's not a hopeless situation.

460
25:50.426 --> 25:52.385
You're just...

461
25:52.385 --> 25:53.545
Don't worry about me.

462
25:53.545 --> 25:54.666
I'm fine.

463
25:54.666 --> 25:56.706
I can still control myself.

464
25:56.706 --> 25:59.059
I know exactly what I want.

465
26:03.186 --> 26:04.986
Platonic unrequited love.

466
26:04.986 --> 26:06.545
Is that what you mean?

467
26:06.545 --> 26:08.545
Exactly.

468
26:08.545 --> 26:11.266
This is my basic law of unrequited love.

469
26:11.266 --> 26:13.026
It's unbreakable.

470
26:13.026 --> 26:17.746
Even Zhao Sheng Ge himself cannot break it?

471
26:17.746 --> 26:19.385
Yes.

472
26:19.385 --> 26:22.466
But only he is worth me keeping it for.

473
26:22.466 --> 26:24.963
It wouldn't work for anyone else.

474
26:26.026 --> 26:29.447
All right. Xuan, get some rest.

475
27:08.585 --> 27:11.286
M-Mr. Zhao.

476
27:15.506 --> 27:16.990
Get out.

477
27:30.946 --> 27:32.572
Get out.

478
27:38.145 --> 27:39.506
Chen Wan.

479
27:39.506 --> 27:41.692
When I play, I play to win.

480
27:43.345 --> 27:44.992
You just got back?

481
27:46.946 --> 27:49.825
Mr. Qin, not resting yet?

482
27:49.825 --> 27:51.266
I'm going to look at the sea.

483
27:51.266 --> 27:53.545
What about you? Why aren't you asleep yet?

484
27:53.545 --> 27:56.385
Mr. Qin, I just went for a walk to digest.

485
27:56.385 --> 27:58.426
Don't be a stranger, Wan.

486
27:58.426 --> 27:59.906
Just call me "Zhao Ting".

487
27:59.906 --> 28:01.545
Tan You Ming calls me that, too.

488
28:01.545 --> 28:03.580
Let's be friends, all right?

489
28:15.145 --> 28:17.345
Mr. Zhao.

490
28:17.345 --> 28:19.625
Sheng Ge, why are you still up?

491
28:19.625 --> 28:21.666
Are you done with your business,

492
28:21.666 --> 28:24.105
or have you not started yet?

493
28:24.105 --> 28:26.026
Chatting in front of someone's door in the middle of the night...

494
28:26.026 --> 28:27.585
Isn't that a bit rude?

495
28:27.585 --> 28:28.666
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

496
28:28.666 --> 28:30.825
I'm sorry for disturbing your rest.

497
28:30.825 --> 28:33.266
Wan, your card skills are very impressive.

498
28:33.266 --> 28:35.226
Can we have a chat?

499
28:35.226 --> 28:38.625
Mr. Qin, I'm going to rest now.

500
28:38.625 --> 28:40.625
Chen Wan.

501
28:40.625 --> 28:42.145
Which floor is the bar on?

502
28:42.145 --> 28:43.145
It's on the second floor.

503
28:43.145 --> 28:44.825
Do you want to go for a drink now?

504
28:44.825 --> 28:46.393
It's so noisy I can't sleep.

505
28:47.706 --> 28:49.065
I'm very sorry.

506
28:49.065 --> 28:50.785
Why don't I go down with you to pick a bottle?

507
28:50.785 --> 28:52.865
Consider it my apology.

508
28:52.865 --> 28:55.105
Let's go.

509
28:55.105 --> 28:56.529
This way, please.

510
29:00.865 --> 29:03.438
Mr. Qin, are you coming for a drink too?

511
29:04.226 --> 29:05.906
I'll pass on the drinks.

512
29:05.906 --> 29:08.345
A beautiful night is hard to come by.

513
29:08.345 --> 29:10.305
There are more important things than drinking.

514
29:10.305 --> 29:11.506
Well then, Mr. Qin,

515
29:11.506 --> 29:13.706
I hope you have a good time tonight.

516
29:13.706 --> 29:15.426
Didn't I say you could call me "Zhao Ting"?

517
29:15.426 --> 29:16.466
Can we go now?

518
29:16.466 --> 29:18.587
Mr. Zhao, this way, please.

519
29:34.825 --> 29:37.145
Mr. Zhao, what would you like to drink?

520
29:37.145 --> 29:38.606
You choose.

521
29:41.666 --> 29:42.785
Then let's have this one.

522
29:42.785 --> 29:44.105
The Earl of Eternity.

523
29:44.105 --> 29:46.746
It has a mellow taste and helps with sleep.

524
29:46.746 --> 29:48.545
I hope you like it.

525
29:48.545 --> 29:50.585
Okay.

526
29:50.585 --> 29:52.159
Hello, sir.

527
29:54.385 --> 29:56.186
I'd like this bottle of Earl of Eternity.

528
29:56.186 --> 29:59.089
Please decant it for me. Thank you.

529
30:00.585 --> 30:02.825
I'm warning you.

530
30:02.825 --> 30:07.385
I don't want to see any strange creatures in my room.

531
30:07.385 --> 30:08.746
It wasn't me.

532
30:08.746 --> 30:10.466
Why would I do such a thing?

533
30:10.466 --> 30:13.405
I'm afraid of being thrown into the sea.

534
30:19.065 --> 30:21.585
- Please enjoy, gentlemen. - Mr. Zhao, try this.

535
30:21.585 --> 30:23.065
Blackcurrant.

536
30:23.065 --> 30:24.666
Black cherry.

537
30:24.666 --> 30:26.585
Violet.

538
30:26.585 --> 30:27.906
Chen Wan.

539
30:27.906 --> 30:30.266
You have good taste in wine.

540
30:30.266 --> 30:32.585
It's been quite hot in Hai City lately.

541
30:44.545 --> 30:46.145
Chen Wan.

542
30:46.145 --> 30:48.706
You don't seem very happy.

543
30:48.706 --> 30:51.825
You're quieter than when Qin Zhao Ting was here.

544
30:51.825 --> 30:54.145
Are you tired?

545
30:54.145 --> 30:55.577
No.

546
31:21.865 --> 31:25.246
If you're tired, you should head back first.

547
31:30.186 --> 31:32.986
All right then. Mr. Zhao, I'll head back now.

548
31:32.986 --> 31:34.065
Take your time with the wine.

549
31:34.065 --> 31:37.286
Call me if you need anything.

550
33:37.360 --> 33:41.680
[Sharing the world as the sun rises over the sea]

551
33:46.880 --> 33:49.160
[Private]

552
33:49.160 --> 33:51.160
[Sharing the world as the sun rises over the sea]

553
34:25.760 --> 34:27.960
[Hai City Bank: 105000 yuan was deducted from your credit card...]

554
34:27.960 --> 34:29.800
[Hai City Bank: 237000 yuan was deducted from your credit card...]

555
34:29.800 --> 34:32.200
[Hai City Bank: 507000 yuan was deducted from your credit card...]

556
34:36.426 --> 34:37.826
Hello?

557
34:37.826 --> 34:39.105
I've noticed my mother has had

558
34:39.105 --> 34:41.346
some large expenditures lately.

559
34:41.346 --> 34:43.012
Where exactly did she go?

560
34:44.906 --> 34:47.946
City of Dreams and Wynn in Macau?

561
34:47.946 --> 34:49.105
Okay, I understand.

562
34:49.105 --> 34:52.041
If anything happens, report to me immediately.

563
35:08.065 --> 35:10.145
Sir, here is your necklace.

564
35:10.145 --> 35:11.585
I'm sure your girlfriend will love it.

565
35:11.585 --> 35:12.986
Thank you.

566
35:12.986 --> 35:14.346
But I bought it for my mother.

567
35:14.346 --> 35:15.385
Oh, I'm sorry.

568
35:15.385 --> 35:18.785
Your mother must be a very beautiful lady.

569
35:18.785 --> 35:19.786
Thank you.

570
35:19.786 --> 35:21.512
You're very welcome.

571
36:20.786 --> 36:21.786
Hello.

572
36:21.786 --> 36:23.985
Please wrap this one up for me as well.

573
36:23.985 --> 36:25.786
These two in the third row.

574
36:25.786 --> 36:27.551
- Thank you. - Sure.

575
36:29.761 --> 36:32.386
Wan, since you like intricate designs,

576
36:32.386 --> 36:34.866
"Everlasting Life" from the Wadang series doesn't suit you.

577
36:34.866 --> 36:36.705
It's too serious and aggressive.

578
36:36.705 --> 36:38.426
Mr. Qin.

579
36:38.426 --> 36:40.906
It's okay, it's for a friend.

580
36:40.906 --> 36:42.826
Then your friend is very lucky.

581
36:42.826 --> 36:45.105
I wonder who it is.

582
36:45.105 --> 36:47.585
Being your friend is also a lucky thing.

583
36:47.585 --> 36:49.885
Do you really think so?

584
36:53.625 --> 36:55.157
Mr. Zhao.

585
36:57.145 --> 36:59.786
Sir, please check your cufflinks.

586
36:59.786 --> 37:01.105
Thank you.

587
37:01.105 --> 37:02.947
Wrap them up for me.

588
37:04.185 --> 37:06.105
I didn't realize you had another friend

589
37:06.105 --> 37:08.643
who would suit these cufflinks.

590
37:58.866 --> 38:00.065
Hello, Mom.

591
38:00.065 --> 38:01.065
Darling.

592
38:01.065 --> 38:03.265
Come with me to Heavenly Empress Temple tomorrow.

593
38:03.265 --> 38:07.265
Dr. Du says my liver is congested and I have too much internal dampness.

594
38:07.265 --> 38:08.545
I've checked the calendar.

595
38:08.545 --> 38:11.986
I should go pray to Mazu.

596
38:11.986 --> 38:13.745
Mom, did you go gambling again today?

597
38:13.745 --> 38:16.426
Darling, pick me up at 4:30 tomorrow.

598
38:16.426 --> 38:18.466
Remember, don't forget, okay?

599
38:18.466 --> 38:21.055
Game! Gotta go, bye!

600
38:36.346 --> 38:39.326
From now on, I'll bring this around.

601
38:49.265 --> 38:52.145
Grandpa, don't worry.

602
38:52.145 --> 38:54.866
I know what I'm doing regarding the cooperation with the Zhaos.

603
38:54.866 --> 38:59.705
Business is all about seeing if the cards in your hand

604
38:59.705 --> 39:01.563
are strong enough.

605
39:03.266 --> 39:06.906
Good, let's look at the Gantt chart for the Lychee Bay project.

606
39:06.906 --> 39:08.866
The Gantt chart is based on a 24-month construction cycle.

607
39:08.866 --> 39:10.185
It's been meticulously prepared.

608
39:10.185 --> 39:12.786
It accurately reflects the start and end times of each phase,

609
39:12.786 --> 39:13.585
the construction duration,

610
39:13.585 --> 39:15.506
and the sequence of progress.

611
39:15.506 --> 39:17.048
It directly...

612
39:19.826 --> 39:22.986
It directly presents the project's implementation schedule.

613
39:22.986 --> 39:24.622
It'll finish...

614
39:32.306 --> 39:34.386
Hello?

615
39:34.386 --> 39:37.065
Xu Zhi Ying is back.

616
39:37.065 --> 39:38.185
I've already made the arrangements.

617
39:38.185 --> 39:40.026
No need to trouble yourself.

618
39:40.026 --> 39:42.506
Have you prayed at Heavenly Empress Temple for the Lychee Bay project?

619
39:42.506 --> 39:45.306
For big matters, you should still pray to the Heavenly Empress.

620
39:45.306 --> 39:47.585
I've never believed in spirits.

621
39:47.585 --> 39:49.618
It's a tradition.

622
39:52.786 --> 39:54.225
The meeting ends at 4:30 P.M.

623
39:54.225 --> 39:55.346
I'll head over then.

624
39:55.346 --> 39:57.545
You... You've really become something.

625
39:57.545 --> 40:00.246
Even the Bodhisattva has to wait for you to finish your meeting.

626
40:02.946 --> 40:05.015
Let's continue.

627
40:11.866 --> 40:15.545
I told you, what happened at the casino really wasn't my fault.

628
40:15.545 --> 40:17.545
I was wondering why I felt so groggy.

629
40:17.545 --> 40:19.426
It turns out the humidity was just too high.

630
40:19.426 --> 40:22.545
This time, let's burn some high incense for the Heavenly Empress.

631
40:22.545 --> 40:24.601
Burn the most expensive one.

632
40:25.625 --> 40:26.705
I really don't understand.

633
40:26.705 --> 40:28.705
Can't you just not go?

634
40:28.705 --> 40:30.946
I specifically had a master calculate this.

635
40:30.946 --> 40:32.466
On the 24th day of the lunar month, the Goddess will hear our prayers.

636
40:32.466 --> 40:34.585
Why is he here?

637
40:34.585 --> 40:35.665
Darling.

638
40:35.665 --> 40:37.958
What are you staring at?

639
40:39.105 --> 40:40.786
I'll wait for you outside.

640
40:40.786 --> 40:42.705
- You go in by yourself. - We came together.

641
40:42.705 --> 40:44.906
The Heavenly Empress will be offended if you don't pray.

642
40:44.906 --> 40:46.786
You should only see the Heavenly Empress once every three months at most.

643
40:46.786 --> 40:47.866
If you worship Mazu too often,

644
40:47.866 --> 40:49.386
she'll think people are being greedy.

645
40:49.386 --> 40:51.426
You just worshipped Lin Mo Niang last month.

646
40:51.426 --> 40:52.705
Why not go to the West Hall this time

647
40:52.705 --> 40:55.786
and have a proper talk with Jingyun Mazu?

648
40:55.786 --> 40:58.026
But I just had the master calculate it.

649
40:58.026 --> 41:01.625
As long as you're sincere, Mazu will surely bless you.

650
41:01.625 --> 41:02.786
How about this?

651
41:02.786 --> 41:05.386
I'll get you another suet jade statue of the Goddess.

652
41:05.386 --> 41:07.786
Then you can pray to Mazu at home.

653
41:07.786 --> 41:09.625
Is that okay?

654
41:09.625 --> 41:11.145
I suppose so.

655
41:11.145 --> 41:14.065
Come on. Let's pray.

656
41:14.065 --> 41:15.786
The auspicious hour has arrived. Heaven and earth are open.

657
41:15.786 --> 41:18.026
Light the incense and bow respectfully.

658
41:18.026 --> 41:19.466
The incense sticks are in the burner.

659
41:19.466 --> 41:21.026
The smoke carries prayers for miles.

660
41:21.026 --> 41:22.346
Communicate with the gods.

661
41:22.346 --> 41:24.572
Do not ask without cause.

662
41:26.946 --> 41:29.145
Mr. Zhao, with your sincerity,

663
41:29.145 --> 41:30.986
Goddess Mazu will surely sense it.

664
41:30.986 --> 41:33.786
Reclaiming the sea at Lychee Bay

665
41:33.786 --> 41:36.466
is a noble deed for the people and trade.

666
41:36.466 --> 41:39.265
But it must align with time and place

667
41:39.265 --> 41:41.545
for harmony and success to follow.

668
41:41.545 --> 41:42.786
Mr. Zhao.

669
41:42.786 --> 41:43.826
It's about time.

670
41:43.826 --> 41:45.065
We should head out.

671
41:45.065 --> 41:46.506
All right.

672
41:46.506 --> 41:48.665
Sir, thank you for your guidance.

673
41:48.665 --> 41:49.946
If anything else comes up,

674
41:49.946 --> 41:52.026
just contact my personal assistant.

675
41:52.026 --> 41:54.265
Understood.

676
41:54.265 --> 41:55.946
Thank you for your hard work, Master.

677
41:55.946 --> 41:57.466
Mr. Zhao, I'll leave you to your business.

678
41:57.466 --> 42:00.665
Please give my regards to the elder Mr. Zhao.

679
42:00.665 --> 42:02.255
This way, please.

680
42:06.105 --> 42:09.786
Sir, what do people pray for over there?

681
42:09.786 --> 42:11.786
The West Hall is for Jingyun Mazu,

682
42:11.786 --> 42:13.625
the Left Attendant of the Heavenly Palace.

683
42:13.625 --> 42:16.466
She presides over wisdom.

684
42:16.466 --> 42:18.145
Wisdom?

685
42:18.145 --> 42:20.426
Does he even need to pray for wisdom?

686
42:20.426 --> 42:23.686
Is there anyone more calculating than him?

687
42:24.545 --> 42:27.105
When was the Goddess's statue last restored?

688
42:27.105 --> 42:28.426
It's been decades.

689
42:28.426 --> 42:31.145
The gold leaf and colors have faded.

690
42:31.145 --> 42:34.545
We're currently raising funds for repairs.

691
42:34.545 --> 42:36.625
If you're interested,

692
42:36.625 --> 42:39.386
you may come with me to offer incense.

693
42:39.386 --> 42:42.425
It would be a good omen.

694
42:42.425 --> 42:43.946
That works.

695
42:43.946 --> 42:45.065
Lukas.

696
42:45.065 --> 42:47.426
Inform them that the next meeting will be moved online.

697
42:47.426 --> 42:48.525
Yes, sir.

698
42:49.545 --> 42:51.064
Please, this way.

699
42:54.386 --> 42:56.426
I hope Goddess Jingyun can bless Zhao Sheng Ge

700
42:56.426 --> 42:58.619
and make the Lychee Bay project a success.

701
43:15.325 --> 43:17.145
Time to get up.

702
43:23.105 --> 43:24.419
Sir.

703
43:25.346 --> 43:27.026
Mr. Zhao.

704
43:27.026 --> 43:29.265
Mr. Chen, Ms. Song.

705
43:29.265 --> 43:32.126
Darling, who is this?

706
43:33.145 --> 43:35.003
This is Mr. Zhao.

707
43:36.026 --> 43:38.426
She's my mother.

708
43:38.426 --> 43:41.265
Darling, why didn't you tell me you knew Mr. Zhao?

709
43:41.265 --> 43:44.026
- Mom. - Mr. Zhao, I've heard so much about you.

710
43:44.026 --> 43:47.185
Has Wan caused you any trouble?

711
43:47.185 --> 43:49.185
He's not very sensible.

712
43:49.185 --> 43:50.426
Mom.

713
43:50.426 --> 43:52.026
Mr. Zhao and I aren't that close.

714
43:52.026 --> 43:56.426
I just happened to have met him at a banquet before.

715
43:56.426 --> 43:58.346
Sir.

716
43:58.346 --> 44:01.065
Sort out if the golden statue be rebuilt or just repaired.

717
44:01.065 --> 44:02.506
Find someone to handle it.

718
44:02.506 --> 44:04.105
Then, talk to Lukas.

719
44:04.105 --> 44:06.906
Mr. Zhao, your kindness is truly boundless.

720
44:06.906 --> 44:08.625
The Goddess will surely bless you.

721
44:08.625 --> 44:10.826
May the Lychee Bay project go smoothly

722
44:10.826 --> 44:13.426
and your family stay safe.

723
44:13.426 --> 44:15.086
This way, please.

724
44:21.145 --> 44:22.585
How can you not be close?

725
44:22.585 --> 44:24.265
He even greeted you.

726
44:24.265 --> 44:26.386
Mom, don't overthink it.

727
44:26.386 --> 44:27.506
We aren't close.

728
44:27.506 --> 44:29.026
He was just being polite.

729
44:29.026 --> 44:30.665
Not close?

730
44:30.665 --> 44:33.545
The "King of Hell" is not someone we should mess with.

731
44:33.545 --> 44:36.145
Otherwise, no amount of praying will help.

732
44:36.145 --> 44:37.946
What "King of Hell"?

733
44:37.946 --> 44:39.306
It's getting late.

734
44:39.306 --> 44:41.466
Let's go home after we finish praying.

735
44:52.386 --> 44:54.026
Mom, we aren't close.

736
44:54.026 --> 44:55.982
He was just being polite.

737
44:57.545 --> 45:00.386
The "King of Hell" is not someone we should mess with.

738
45:00.386 --> 45:03.049
Otherwise, no amount of praying will help.

739
45:17.065 --> 45:19.986
Redo the budget for Lychee Bay.

740
45:19.986 --> 45:20.986
What's wrong?

741
45:20.986 --> 45:23.105
Is there a problem?

742
45:23.105 --> 45:25.012
This figure is inauspicious.

743
45:26.906 --> 45:30.225
Zhao Sheng Ge, what happened to you at Heavenly Empress Temple?

744
45:30.225 --> 45:31.745
We've been on this project for so long,

745
45:31.745 --> 45:32.986
and only now you say it's inauspicious?

746
45:32.986 --> 45:36.011
Nian, talk some sense into him.

747
45:37.607 --> 45:40.306
It is a bit inauspicious.

748
45:40.306 --> 45:42.306
Let's redo the budget.

749
45:42.306 --> 45:44.571
Whatever you say.

750
45:54.906 --> 45:58.005
The "King of Hell"?

751
46:10.132 --> 46:11.476
Fourth ring.

752
46:11.476 --> 46:12.861
Sixth ring.

753
46:12.861 --> 46:13.894
Eighth ring.

754
46:13.894 --> 46:16.026
I heard Minglong is investing in Lychee Bay.

755
46:16.026 --> 46:17.026
Did you guys know?

756
46:17.026 --> 46:19.466
They even partnered with the ship king.

757
46:19.466 --> 46:21.386
Everyone knows that.

758
46:21.386 --> 46:22.705
My dad said that

759
46:22.705 --> 46:24.665
if the Lychee Bay port is completed,

760
46:24.665 --> 46:27.906
at least 80 percent of the freighters in Hai City will have to dock there.

761
46:27.906 --> 46:30.826
It's deep, sheltered, and has a long coastline.

762
46:30.826 --> 46:33.145
Its cargo capacity is unrivaled.

763
46:33.145 --> 46:34.185
That's impressive.

764
46:34.185 --> 46:35.786
When the terminal is finished,

765
46:35.786 --> 46:37.826
I'll apply for the maiden voyage.

766
46:37.826 --> 46:38.906
Give it a rest.

767
46:38.906 --> 46:40.185
Let's all compete on our own merits.

768
46:40.185 --> 46:42.346
Business is business, even among friends.

769
46:42.346 --> 46:43.745
This is a major event for financial news.

770
46:43.745 --> 46:45.065
So, how was it?

771
46:45.065 --> 46:48.145
Did you see my heroic performance just now?

772
46:48.145 --> 46:49.866
I saw it.

773
46:49.866 --> 46:51.978
Three shots, all missed.

774
46:53.705 --> 46:54.786
Wan.

775
46:54.786 --> 46:58.585
You've been joking around more and more lately.

776
46:58.585 --> 47:02.786
It seems Monica's treatment is really working.

777
47:02.786 --> 47:04.746
Then I really should thank you.

778
47:04.746 --> 47:05.786
Don't mention it.

779
47:05.786 --> 47:07.306
If you have any other wishes, just ask.

780
47:07.306 --> 47:09.906
But don't ask for money, I don't have any.

781
47:09.906 --> 47:11.306
Then I want...

782
47:11.306 --> 47:13.545
the maiden voyage of Lychee Bay.

783
47:18.625 --> 47:20.386
You're really putting me on the spot.

784
47:20.386 --> 47:24.306
Hey! Mr. Zhao, Mr. Tan, Mr. Shen!

785
47:24.306 --> 47:27.105
- What a coincidence. - Speak of the devil.

786
47:27.105 --> 47:29.306
Welcome to my new shooting club.

787
47:29.306 --> 47:31.506
We were just talking about Lychee Bay,

788
47:31.506 --> 47:33.426
and vying for the maiden voyage rights.

789
47:33.426 --> 47:34.466
That's easy.

790
47:34.466 --> 47:35.625
It goes to the highest bidder.

791
47:35.625 --> 47:38.545
I heard you're increasing the budget.

792
47:38.545 --> 47:41.745
Someone thinks the numbers are unlucky.

793
47:41.745 --> 47:42.745
That's Zhao Mao Zheng's idea.

794
47:42.745 --> 47:45.145
He's getting old and superstitious.

795
47:45.145 --> 47:47.346
You wouldn't want a Titanic-style maiden voyage, would you?

796
47:47.346 --> 47:49.346
The old man is too superstitious,

797
47:49.346 --> 47:52.426
but you're being too careless.

798
47:52.426 --> 47:53.699
Let's go.

799
47:57.426 --> 47:58.745
Let's go take a break.

800
47:58.745 --> 47:59.906
Xuan, I'm not going.

801
47:59.906 --> 48:01.225
I'll practice shooting a bit more.

802
48:01.225 --> 48:02.746
You guys go ahead.

803
48:13.386 --> 48:15.582
Wan, how is it?

804
48:17.306 --> 48:19.625
Wan, have you done this before?

805
48:19.625 --> 48:21.145
If not,

806
48:21.145 --> 48:24.185
I suggest starting with these two entry-level models.

807
48:24.185 --> 48:26.625
The Ruisi Star R100, or the Falcon X5.

808
48:26.625 --> 48:29.584
The recoil feedback is quite realistic.

809
48:43.466 --> 48:45.946
Do you know how to hold a gun?

810
48:45.946 --> 48:47.925
I'll teach you.

811
48:52.145 --> 48:53.386
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

812
48:53.386 --> 48:55.185
But I'm good.

813
48:55.185 --> 48:57.265
I just watched and learned a bit.

814
48:57.265 --> 48:58.426
I'll figure it out on my own.

815
48:58.426 --> 48:59.745
I'm the host.

816
48:59.745 --> 49:02.103
I should look after everyone.

817
49:08.705 --> 49:11.766
Mr. Zhao, watch out for a misfire.

818
49:16.745 --> 49:18.705
That's enough, Mr. Qin.

819
49:18.705 --> 49:20.526
I'll figure it out on my own.

820
49:36.146 --> 49:40.266
The "King of Hell" is not someone we should mess with.

821
49:40.266 --> 49:43.046
King of Hell...
